p><span>16</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>挺常见的，其实卖家没什么责任</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326494\" data-reply-id=\"18326494\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51b2/1e19/770709_normal.png?m=1795161648\" alt=\"AnQiYang\" data-uid=\"770709\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>17</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/ROCKY777\">ROCKY777</a> 我帮你说话呢。我觉得你是受害者，而 1 楼的人觉得你得自己受着。我觉得对方做的不地道，多少得退点</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326505\" data-reply-id=\"18326505\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f8d0/1045/102641_normal.png?m=1641529094\" alt=\"milkleeeeee\" data-uid=\"102641\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>18</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>这个得看卖家的售前说明吧……我记得现在基本都是在售前就说过，只帮过 kyc，不管封不封号的</p>\n<p>或者就加价买已经过了 kyc 的账号，但价格应该就不一样了</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326530\" data-reply-id=\"18326530\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bf67f668cca5ea54a8acb014b8051bf7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"heyDemon\" data-uid=\"342305\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>19</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>你已经说了你用了一会儿封掉了，这就很难讲是因为你还是因为他的原因被封，kyc 认证费用只管认证，不管封不封</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326563\" data-reply-id=\"18326563\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a0abe1a85ec3b31c6a1bb3385db0535d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Anarchy\" data-uid=\"347960\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>20</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>有点好奇你认为的应该退你部分钱是觉得是什么理由，看你可怜么？感觉你应该是买成品号的逻辑吧。</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326604\" data-reply-id=\"18326604\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80ac/32fc/580231_normal.png?m=1755248272\" alt=\"ndxxx\" data-uid=\"580231\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/ndxxx\">ndxxx</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-25 16:17:51 +08:00\">19h 33m ago via Android</span></p></div>\n            <p><span>22</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>商家日常文字游戏，「包过」，潜台词「包过不包封」</p>\n<p>收完你的钱, 然后拿着你的 cookie 一类的东西去一个程序里 setup 好, 然后找外国的真人在那个自制的程序里给你过验证. 然后通知你过了, 你也就确认付款/甚至先款了. 然后过几天你的号还是被封了, 这时候你发现你已经被拉黑了😀</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326645\" data-reply-id=\"18326645\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9120/a880/92158_normal.png?m=1689669248\" alt=\"haorrs\" data-uid=\"92158\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>23</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>一般这种就是，显示\"Done\"，就算钱货两清了。我自己搞 kyc，通过之后 10 秒就收到封号邮件😂</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326656\" data-reply-id=\"18326656\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cb98ba7ca393ba597d83f771cf300eb7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hoythan\" data-uid=\"143072\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>24</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>KYC 是 KYC，封号是封号，这是两个概念你不要混为一谈。<br>\nClaude 的 KYC 你可以理解分为 2 个情况：<br>\n1.单纯的 KYC，认证过后就可以继续使用。<br>\n2.本来就要封号 KYC 后可以封的更彻底。</p>\n<p>你只是属于第二种情况，你就算让特朗普给你 KYC 也得封号。</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326886\" data-reply-id=\"18326886\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d961/3cd9/563553_normal.png?m=1749532589\" alt=\"SayHelloHi\" data-uid=\"563553\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>26</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>都这样</p>\n<p>有的卖家 质保 10 分钟 过了封号不退款的</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326905\" data-reply-id=\"18326905\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/55579e415f3d312d5b8905b3b9ec0761?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"longaiwp\" data-uid=\"139260\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>27</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>这个事情真是灰色地带吧，确实人家的服务不应该包含封不封号，毕竟服务内容是 KYC</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326924\" data-reply-id=\"18326924\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/162a/2584/69678_normal.png?m=1700057630\" alt=\"huage\" data-uid=\"69678\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>28</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>为啥别人要退你款呢？是人家没给做还是咋滴，一看就是给淘宝拼多多惯出来的</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326996\" data-reply-id=\"18326996\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https:/